<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1186] OpenKeyTypeObjectHashMap#clear() has been broken forever.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1186</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Arrays.clear(array, 0, array.length - 1, FREE);&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Means that the last entry in the array is &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; FREE, and hence arrays.clear only &lt;b&gt;sometimes&lt;/b&gt; empties the array, and hence only &lt;b&gt;sometimes&lt;/b&gt; clears out all of the entries in the map.  Other times, it leaves one element behind. &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/sad.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12641082">MAHOUT-1186</key>
            <summary>OpenKeyTypeObjectHashMap#clear() has been broken forever.</summary>
