                            <comment id="13623871" author="jake.mannix" created="Fri, 5 Apr 2013 18:02:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Unit test in this patch &lt;b&gt;fails&lt;/b&gt; on trunk.  Passes with the fix.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13623885" author="jake.mannix" created="Fri, 5 Apr 2013 18:12:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for catching this, Andy.  Slipped by the unit test because we were a) only checking size() == 0, and b) this only happens if the item added happens to land in the last bucket of the backing array.  Sneaky!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13624514" author="hudson" created="Sat, 6 Apr 2013 21:40:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #1950 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1950/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1950/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
